WEBVTT

NOTE Narration of the 24-second product overview (real product interface, recorded August 2026).
NOTE Cues are the narration word for word. The line "and they stay undoable" is not accurate for Alpha.20:
only one undo exists (the last StudyState Sample evidence update) and platform rollback is not supported.

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.920
AI chats forget.

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.040
Your work shouldn't.

3
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.390
StatePort gives AI

4
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:05.660
assisted work a durable

5
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.680
home on your own machine.

6
00:00:07.855 --> 00:00:10.405
A real app retains its context.

7
00:00:10.495 --> 00:00:12.085
The study plan, the progress,

8
00:00:12.085 --> 00:00:14.565
the evidence, not a blank chat box.

9
00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:16.633
Consequential changes are reviewed

10
00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:18.213
before they land,

11
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:19.523
